Minecraft and the Mojang mappings
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Minecraft: Copyright (c) Mojang Synergies AB / Microsoft. Not redistributable.
This repository contains no Minecraft binaries; `fabric-loom` downloads the
client jar from Mojang's publish servers during the build, and the mappings
(`loom.officialMojangMappings()`) are likewise obtained from Mojang at build
time under the terms of their own license.

Note for anyone republishing a build: the *mapped* Minecraft classes must not be
distributed. `remapJar` output is fine to publish (it contains only Aetherium
classes plus shaded MixinExtras), which is why the build does not produce a
"fat" jar containing game code.

