LWJGL
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Lightweight Java Game Library 3 - BSD-3-Clause - Copyright (c) LWJGL (lwjgl.org)
    https://github.com/LWJGL/lwjgl3
The GL entry points in `com.aetherium.render.gl.GlProcs` route through LWJGL's
`GL43C`/`GL45C`/`GL46C`/`GL44C`/`GL41`/`GL30`/`GL31C`/`GL32`/`GL40` host classes
and `GLARB*` extension classes. Every constant is declared numerically in
`GlProcs`, with the LWJGL field it was read from recorded in a comment, because
an enum value that only exists in a newer LWJGL breaks a build on an older one for
no reason.

